# MCP Server Installation for research-kb
#
# Recommended: Use claude mcp add (writes to ~/.claude.json, user-global scope)
#
#   claude mcp add -s user research-kb \
#     -- /home/brandon_behring/Claude/research-kb/.venv/bin/research-kb-mcp
#
# This makes research-kb tools available to ALL ~/Claude/* projects.
#
# Config hierarchy (highest priority first):
#   1. .mcp.json (project scope) — overrides everything
#   2. ~/.claude.json mcpServers (user scope) — recommended for research-kb
#
# Do NOT use ~/.claude/settings.local.json for MCP servers.
# Do NOT create .mcp.json unless you need project-specific overrides.
